{
  "name": "watanabe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 72.728,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "You run a casino.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.897,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "03b05a0bcb16"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Your best customer can barely stand up.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.94,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "03b05a0bcb16"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01b",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Do you cut him off?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.965,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6867c645d33f"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Terrance Watanabe ran his family's party-supply company in Omaha for over twenty years.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.311,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "181f4ec3b32a"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Then he sold it, and found Las Vegas.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.028,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "181f4ec3b32a"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "His drinking got so bad that one casino, the Wynn, banned him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.47,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "67e3154d4563"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Caesars Palace and the Rio did the opposite.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.93,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "7a42f828d9b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "They gave him a bellman of his own, and a personal security guard.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.405,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "7a42f828d9b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "On big losses, he reportedly got fifteen percent back.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.742,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "7a42f828d9b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In two thousand seven, by his own count, he bet more than eight hundred and twenty-five million dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.55,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "e545fcaa2c64"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He lost nearly a hundred and twenty-seven million.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.382,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "e545fcaa2c64"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "That one man was five point six percent of the company's Las Vegas gambling revenue.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.358,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "e545fcaa2c64"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06a",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Three casino workers later said he was drunk almost every time he played.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.465,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "554f3cc6084d"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Some nights he fell asleep at the table, woke up, and kept betting.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.416,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "940271d3d6ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His sister finally stepped in, and he went to rehab.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.886,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "07576e9b41a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He had paid back almost everything.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.952,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "07576e9b41a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "But fourteen point seven million dollars stayed unpaid.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.266,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "07576e9b41a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08a",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So the casino took him to the district attorney.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.188,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "471a3f2ead41"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08a",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "He was charged with four felonies, and faced up to twenty-eight years.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.781,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "471a3f2ead41"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08a",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "His answer: the casino had kept him drunk to keep him playing.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.231,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "471a3f2ead41"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08b",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In the end, the charges were dropped, and both sides settled in private.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.033,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4270f1f02d71"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08b",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Years later, New Jersey regulators fined Caesars two hundred and twenty-five thousand dollars over how it handled him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.253,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4270f1f02d71"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08b",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "That's less than a fifth of one percent of what he lost.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.091,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4270f1f02d71"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So when a casino's best customer can't stand up, who is supposed to say stop?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/watanabe/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.188,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9bf2affdd26a"
    }
  ]
}
